{"unit_id":"rinDBeans__dsh-nocturne#card-card-zh","repo":"rinDBeans/dsh-nocturne","commit":"0da5db49de437e66965ca733220c9dfc344d1508","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"缮写室是面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的界面主题插件，通过 WebGL2 双通道着色器实时绘制纸张纤维与光照，并把纸面效果叠加在原生界面上。它提供六种纸张和三种光照空间，可调灯光、纸纹与动效；也加入墨迹或羽毛笔光标、纸夹滚动条，以及原生设置页。适合希望把 DSH 阅读和书写界面改成纸本风格的用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号；桌面设置写入 DSH_HOME 下的本地缓存文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter.js:639-670","src/core/state.js:100-130","src/core/paper-light.js:6-16","src/settings-page.js:99-153"]}
{"unit_id":"rinDBeans__dsh-nocturne#card-card-en","repo":"rinDBeans/dsh-nocturne","commit":"0da5db49de437e66965ca733220c9dfc344d1508","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Nocturne is a DSH web and desktop theme that uses WebGL2 to render paper texture and lighting. Choose from six papers and three lighting environments, and adjust them in the native settings panel. It also offers ink or quill cursors and a paperclip scrollbar. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter.js:639-670","src/core/state.js:100-130","src/core/paper-light.js:6-16","src/settings-page.js:99-153"]}
